A namespace convention:

| Prefix   | Meaning                  |
| -------- | ------------------------ |
| `raw_`   | imported, untouched data |
| `clean_` | cleaned/reformatted data |
| `dat_`   | analytical dataset       |
| `fit_`   | statistical model        |
| `tbl_`   | table                    |
| `fig_`   | figure                   |
| `icc_`   | ICC results              |
| `res_`   | statistical results      |
| `pred_`  | model predictions        |
